@* 2026-10-17: moved onto FeatureDemoLayout (row 3 of the Data Grid list). Same 1,000 rows and 21 columns. Changes, closing SC-132 to
   SC-134: a line under the grid reads the grid's own ColumnVirtualizationStatus so a viewer can see that windowing is on; the
   developer-syntax card header went; Height="100%" became the 520px the old card gave the grid. AllowMultiColumnSorting="true" was
   removed because no such parameter exists in FlexCore (it fell through as an unmatched attribute); ShowMultiColumnSortingIndex went
